    "svgcontent": "<svg width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:html=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g><title>Layer 1</title><rect id=\"svg_e665d3e1-c35f-4583-a8f6-8342a5234cb8\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#141c26\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_47e02072-51ba-46a5-a824-1bd018f50f50\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">MECHANISM SETUP</text><g id=\"HXB_c7003d28-28e7-443d-ae73-a7605aae7e9d\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_9c2acb4c-7932-480a-8747-fa117460084d\" x=\"1430\" y=\"16\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_0dfe1f1a-7657-4bcc-862e-0e0b99c80228\" x=\"1430\" y=\"16\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_ef10f223-660a-4457-bcb0-09838752d1b8\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Overview</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_a59cb366-6c7b-45b9-870f-f44675cfffb7\" x=\"20\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Adjust the simulated mechanisms; every axis follows the virtual master axis (position = ratio \u00d7 master + phase + cam).</text><rect id=\"svg_12dc4668-38b6-4c47-9c09-af361e7f6b47\" x=\"20\" y=\"74\" width=\"1560\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_808d8614-8ed7-4f61-b962-11e44108397c\" x=\"40\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Master speed (rpm)</text><g id=\"HXI